{
  "slug": "holomime",
  "name": "Holomime",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Behavioral alignment for AI agents. Detect drift with 8 rule-based detectors, stress-test with adversarial benchmarks (grade A-F), visualize behavioral patterns in 3D, and run structured therapy sessions that generate DPO training data. Six slash commands — zero to aligned in one install.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `autopilot` (Automatically diagnose behavioral drift, run a therapy session, and apply corrections to the personality spec), `benchmark` (Stress-test an AI agent's behavioral alignment with 8 adversarial scenarios), `brain` (Launch a 3D real-time visualization of an AI agent's behavioral patterns), `diagnose` (Detect behavioral drift patterns in AI agent conversations), `profile` (Display a human-readable summary of an AI agent's personality spec), `session` (Run a structured behavioral therapy session for an AI agent)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install holomime@claude-community` from `productstein/holomime` (`integrations/claude-code-skill`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
